<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβῐβάζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βιβῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					426
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				166
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				229e
			</span></i>:—causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβαίνω</span>, <i>cause to approach, bring near</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑαυτὸν κινδύνοις</span>
			<i>expose . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>liken, make to resemble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>bring over, persuade</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ προσβιβάζεις με</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῇδε καὶ τὸ κεῖσε καὶ τὸ δεῦρο
					προσβιβᾷ λέγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Av.</u>
					426
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ λόγῳ προσβιβάζειν
			[τινάς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				36
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβιβασθῆναι πρὸς τὴν ἀλήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Philops.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>add</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τούτοις τὸν κολοφῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					153c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.73K.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κατὰ τὸ εἰκὸς ἕκαστον</span>
			<i>reduce</i> it into accordance with probability, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				229e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἄλλα π. κατὰ γράμματα καὶ κατὰ
				συλλαβάς</span>
			<i>reduce</i> to letters and syllables, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				427c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>prove</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				49.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
